---
title: "A rebuild is current only when facts and document agree"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: idle: facts 0, document 0, current
  s1: building: facts 0, document 0, partial
  s2: built: facts 0, document 0, partial
  s3: failed: facts 0, document 0, partial
  s4: written: facts 0, document 1, partial
  s5: failed: facts 0, document 1, partial
  s6: done: facts 1, document 1, current
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: start rebuild
  s1 --> s2: build facts
  s1 --> s3: write fails or process stops
  s2 --> s3: write fails or process stops
  s2 --> s4: write document
  s4 --> s5: write fails or process stops
  s4 --> s6: commit consistent outputs
